    NEWLINE@21..22 "\n"
    NEWLINE@22..23 "\n"
    LINE_COMMENT@23..118 "// The syntax of helpers (objects.md 10.1): `class helper` and `record helper` with a parent in"
    NEWLINE@118..119 "\n"
    LINE_COMMENT@119..214 "// parentheses, the type after `for` and a class body. After `record`, `helper` followed by `,`"
    NEWLINE@214..215 "\n"
    LINE_COMMENT@215..312 "// or `:` is a field. A helper has no forward declaration (E0400 expects `end`), and like a class"
    NEWLINE@312..313 "\n"
    LINE_COMMENT@313..396 "// it is declared only in a `type` section (E0404 elsewhere, skipped to its `end`)."
    NEWLINE@396..397 "\n"
    NEWLINE@397..398 "\n"
